## Triage — ZD-48213 (cart badge doesn't update after wishlist add)

**Repro/analysis.** The reported pattern (stale count → correct after refresh) points to the header badge and the wishlist add-to-cart handler not sharing state, so I traced both paths instead of guessing:

`search_code("api/cart/items")` → three hits: `src/app/api/cart/items/route.ts`, `src/components/product/AddToCartButton.tsx`, `src/components/wishlist/WishlistItemCard.tsx`.

The badge reads a client-side cache:

```tsx
// src/lib/cart/use-cart-count.ts
export function useCartCount() {
  const { data } = useSWR<CartSummary>("/api/cart", fetcher, { revalidateOnFocus: false });
  return data?.itemCount ?? 0;
}
```

The two add-to-cart call sites are **not** symmetric:

```tsx
// AddToCartButton.tsx (product page) — revalidates after success ✅
await fetch("/api/cart/items", { ... });
await mutate("/api/cart");

// WishlistItemCard.tsx — POSTs and stops there ❌
const res = await fetch("/api/cart/items", { method: "POST", ... });
if (!res.ok) throw new Error(String(res.status));
toast({ title: "Added to cart" });
```

**Root cause:** the wishlist handler never revalidates the `/api/cart` SWR key, so the header badge keeps rendering the cached count (0) until a full reload refetches it — exactly matching the ticket. Not browser-specific; the Chrome detail is incidental. Search confirms only these two client call sites POST to `/api/cart/items`, so the wishlist is the only gap. No contact with `/src/payments` or `/src/auth`.

## Fix (scoped to the ticket)

```diff
// src/components/wishlist/WishlistItemCard.tsx
+ import { mutate } from "swr";

  async function handleAddToCart() {
    setAdding(true);
    try {
      const res = await fetch("/api/cart/items", {
        method: "POST",
        headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
        body: JSON.stringify({ variantId: item.variantId, quantity: 1 }),
      });
      if (!res.ok) throw new Error(String(res.status));
+     await mutate("/api/cart"); // keep header badge in sync (same as AddToCartButton)
      toast({ title: "Added to cart" });
    } finally {
      setAdding(false);
    }
  }
```

